<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-types/def/data-type/elevation-model> a dt:DataType, rim:Concept, skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme dt:dataTypes ; skos:prefLabel "Elevation model"@en ; skos:definition "A single-band raster whose values are elevations of the terrain or of a surface (DEM, DTM, DSM)."@en ; skos:broader <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-types/def/data-type/raster-single-band> ; dct:source [ dct:title "OGC 09-146r8 Coverage Implementation Schema (CIS) 1.1.1, §6.5 RangeType"@en ; dct:references <https://docs.ogc.org/is/09-146r8/09-146r8.html> ], [ dct:title "INSPIRE D2.8.II.1 Data Specification on Elevation – Technical Guidelines (2024-01-31), Executive Summary: Digital Elevation Model, Digital Terrain Model, Digital Surface Model"@en ; dct:references <https://inspire.ec.europa.eu/id/document/tg/el> ] .
